text.en:
The shift depends on the low bit of `phase`, and the outputs are masked by `active`.
```vhdl
if active = '0' then
    if start = '1' then shreg <= din; phase <= (others=>'0'); active <= '1'; end if;
else
    if phase(0) = '1' then shreg <= shreg(6 downto 0) & '0'; end if;
    phase <= phase + 1;
end if;
-- ...
sclk <= phase(0) when active='1' else '0';
mosi <= shreg(7) when active='1' else '0';
```

text.es:
El desplazamiento depende del bit bajo de `phase`, y las salidas se enmascaran con `active`.
```vhdl
if active = '0' then
    if start = '1' then shreg <= din; phase <= (others=>'0'); active <= '1'; end if;
else
    if phase(0) = '1' then shreg <= shreg(6 downto 0) & '0'; end if;
    phase <= phase + 1;
end if;
-- ...
sclk <= phase(0) when active='1' else '0';
mosi <= shreg(7) when active='1' else '0';
```
